# Change log

## 0.4.0 (2026-06-17)

- Support GPT-5.5 reasoning_effort values (none, xhigh) and add "5.5" engine alias
- Require openai 2.x (^2.0); 2.x formally recognizes the "none"/"xhigh" reasoning_effort values
- Migrate pyproject.toml to PEP 621 for Poetry 2.x

## 0.3.0 (2026-02-21)

- Add GPT-5 model support with new parameters (max_completion_tokens, reasoning_effort, verbosity)
- Update typer/click version constraints for Click 8.2+ compatibility

## 0.2.4 (2024-08.28)

- use gpt-4o-mini as a default

## 0.2.3 (2024-02.12)

- openai 1.* API
- Prepare i18n README files

## 0.2.2 (2023-11-17)

## 0.2.1 (2023-11-06)
